        "eyebrow": "The material",
        "heading": "A material with character.",
        "text": "<p>Brass is an alloy of copper and zinc, prized for its warm tone and the way it takes a finish. Uncoated brass darkens and softens with wear. Coated and plated finishes behave differently.</p><p>Every piece lists its actual finish and how to care for it, so you know how it will change.</p>",
